    "name": "Unrivaled Heroes: 2.5D Brawler",
    "steam_appid": 2690830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrivaled Heroes: 2.5D Brawler</strong> is 2.5D side-scrolling beat-'em-up where players experience the thrill of multiple unrivaled heroes, each with unique abilities. Master martial arts, unleash powerful skills, and conquer epic bosses. With <strong>local co-op for up to 4 players</strong>, team up for intense combat and a truly unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/2eff4208bd4e92ac8eb3ebfa794e17ae.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in <strong>medieval Indonesia</strong>, this game transports players to an era where powerful kingdoms ruled over vast archipelagos. <strong>Inspired by Indonesian folklore and mythology</strong>, legendary tales come to life through epic battles, brought together with <strong>stunning visuals that blend 2D and 3D elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/f84c949c6d67b3474a29bcd80dfbdf0f.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique skills and ultimate abilities of each hero, adapting to different playstyles to conquer malevolent creatures bent on world destruction. As you progress, the journey unfolds deeper into the narrative, with escalating challenges that test your mastery of every character\u2019s distinct combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/d514cdf239b7662229de4db75558ea4c.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with a partner in <strong>co-op mode</strong>, combining unique playstyles to overcome relentless enemies and formidable challenges. As the battles intensify, teamwork becomes essential, pushing both players to strategize and adapt in order to survive and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5f79f12595696e90b74e961607589640.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chapter unfolds a <strong>new story</strong>, introducing <strong>fresh challenges</strong>, characters, and environments to explore. As the journey progresses, uncover deeper lore and unexpected twists that shape the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/cebb47e1169b21850309978544c6b0c9.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle and confront each boss in their domain, where deadly attacks and relentless minions await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/b49ade08f9eccfd43866a27edf9172c0.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrivaled Heroes: 2.5D Brawler</strong> is 2.5D side-scrolling beat-'em-up where players experience the thrill of multiple unrivaled heroes, each with unique abilities. Master martial arts, unleash powerful skills, and conquer epic bosses. With <strong>local co-op for up to 4 players</strong>, team up for intense combat and a truly unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/2eff4208bd4e92ac8eb3ebfa794e17ae.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/ab2eeae563e1600786308fbd44ec80a4.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in <strong>medieval Indonesia</strong>, this game transports players to an era where powerful kingdoms ruled over vast archipelagos. <strong>Inspired by Indonesian folklore and mythology</strong>, legendary tales come to life through epic battles, brought together with <strong>stunning visuals that blend 2D and 3D elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/f84c949c6d67b3474a29bcd80dfbdf0f.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/0dc40560b357154d411be858cc76cfb7.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique skills and ultimate abilities of each hero, adapting to different playstyles to conquer malevolent creatures bent on world destruction. As you progress, the journey unfolds deeper into the narrative, with escalating challenges that test your mastery of every character\u2019s distinct combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/d514cdf239b7662229de4db75558ea4c.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5b3213a442c4ef9065cc4a24fb293dbb.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with a partner in <strong>co-op mode</strong>, combining unique playstyles to overcome relentless enemies and formidable challenges. As the battles intensify, teamwork becomes essential, pushing both players to strategize and adapt in order to survive and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/5f79f12595696e90b74e961607589640.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/97dd82c7bb2df8655b92b713d304b6e7.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chapter unfolds a <strong>new story</strong>, introducing <strong>fresh challenges</strong>, characters, and environments to explore. As the journey progresses, uncover deeper lore and unexpected twists that shape the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/cebb47e1169b21850309978544c6b0c9.webp?t=1750584001\" width=612 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.poster.avif?t=1750584001\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.webm?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690830/extras/84587eba87b40d07f947a46789580f17.mp4?t=1750584001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle and confront each boss in their domain, where deadly attacks and relentless minions await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
